<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαλλοτρι-όω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηλλοτρίωκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.194
				</span></i>
			:—<i>estrange, alienate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφ᾽ ὑμῶν τὸν ἐπὶ Θρᾴκης
			τόπον</span> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον -οῦντα κακίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristo Stoic.
					1.80
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.1.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be alienated,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>from</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.79.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
				389.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span> towards one,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				7.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηλλοτριωμένην πρὸς φυτείαν ἀμπέλου
					χώραν</span>”
				<i>ill-suited for . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.73
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of property,
				<i>alienate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1361a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.32<i>B</i>68
			</span></i> (Olbia, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1157v
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 iii3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of things, <i>separate, distinguish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				58
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>alter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				65d
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>remove,</i> in Surgery, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.26.13
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			):—
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.789
			</span></i>.</div>
